    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d93">

                <pb facs="0148" n="882" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg882"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Young.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-24"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President disappointed in not being advised that Honduras’s promise to act
                    promptly in Renton case has been fulfilled. Atrocity of murder and violation of
                    property call for instant efficient justice. Urge action. Report progress.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
